Location: Brazil (Remote)

&nbsp;

We Are:&nbsp;

RTB House is a next-generation performance demand-side platform (DSP) that uses proprietary Deep Learning AI algorithms to help brands grow. The company is the market leader in driving performance using Deep Learning across the entire purchase funnel.

Founded in 2012 and now operating in 90+ markets, RTB House has always been private-by-design. It embraces first-party advertising and a relentless approach to innovation. RTB House offers end-to-end Deep Learning-powered AdTech products and solutions to maximize conversion, drive new customer acquisition, create engagement, and fuel long-term demand for a global base of clients.

In 2026, RTB House launched rtb.com, a self-service platform specifically designed to allow small and medium-sized businesses and agencies to deploy auto-built creatives and maximize performance on any budget.

&nbsp;

Why RTB House:

As an Ad Operations Specialist at RTB House, you will oversee the creation of new banner ads for the US Market. You will serve as the liaison between the account management team and our internal creative, developer, and technical account management teams. Responsibilities will include understanding the general business goals of our clients, taking ownership of the US banner orders queue, and facilitating the efficient and successful development of banner ads for our US customers. To succeed in this role you must be self-motivated, organized, and have a strong desire to learn and grow in a fast-paced and collaborative environment.

&nbsp;

You Will:

• Serve as the main point of contact for coordinating with internal graphics designer teams on new client creative orders, promotional banners, and other creative advertising materials

• Support account managers and sales managers with knowledge on new and existing creatives products and processes

• Regularly conduct quality assurance of creative advertising materials

• Assist technical account managers with campaign integration and optimization tasks.

&nbsp;

Desired Experience:&nbsp;

• Bachelor’s degree or 2+ years of practical experience in the digital advertising space.

• Fluent In English

• Strong communication skills.&nbsp;

• Strong time management skills, attention to detail and self organization abilities.

• Ability to solve problems efficiently.

• Interest in online technology, e-commerce and/or digital advertising.

• Highly self-motivated with a willingness to learn.

&nbsp;

We Offer:&nbsp;

• competitive salary and incentives plan, based on experience and increasing performance;

• the joy of working and learning in one of the fastest growing sectors in online advertising;

• a rewarding career in a friendly and inspiring atmosphere;

• the opportunity to participate in ambitious projects in the growing, international organization;

• your ideas and creations will have a chance to make an impact and lead the market.

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Apply now!&nbsp;

